Author: Yixing User [aut, cre],
    Liqun Diao [ctb],
    Yechao Meng [ctb],
    Chengguo Weng [ctb]
Maintainer: Yixing User <y679zhao@uwaterloo.ca>
Description: Implements mortality forecasting workflows based on
    deletion-substitution-addition population selection, age-specific band
    selection, and bivariate model-based ensemble methods. The package works
    with demography::demogdata mortality datasets and exposes parameterized
    age and year windows so the methods can be applied beyond the empirical
    Human Mortality Database settings used in the source papers.
